(text "BM83SM1-00TA (DS70005402D). BAT_IN 3.2-4.2 V from 3V8_BT (U15); SYS_PWR/VDD_IO are outputs (decoupling only, do not load or feed). ADAP_IN unused (internal charger/USB DFU not used)." (at 77.47 170.3 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "722a60b6-d25f-46a1-bffb-b53e177b9dc7"))
(text "Host mode UART from the MCU: P8_6 RXD / P8_5 TXD, P0_0 = UART_TX_IND (wakes the MCU). MFB (PWR) = power-on/wake key, RST_N = reset (active low, internal pull-up). Config Tool must set Host mode, P0_0 as TX_IND." (at 77.47 173.3 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "29635a0b-8c89-432e-b734-8ba7b6760b51"))
(text "Back-power: MCU lines pass 10k/1k series resistors; firmware must drive PA2/PB3 low (PB4 open-drain/hi-Z) and disable BT_PWR_EN only after the module power-off ACK. Module outputs are 3.0-3.6 V into 5 V tolerant MCU pins." (at 77.47 176.3 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0740fc79-0018-42cf-8816-0767dacf9962"))
(text "Audio: single-ended DAC out (AOHPL/AOHPR) AC-coupled, 4.7 uF + 100k bleed, 0.74 Vrms full scale; AOHPM (capless sense) unused. Ports feed the later source-select sheet." (at 77.47 179.3 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5189536f-7b67-4e87-a725-7f08dfce5a94"))
(text "Antenna: integrated PCB antenna, no external RF parts. Keep the antenna end of the module off the board (no copper/components/keep-out) and metal 15 mm clear; see ai-files/reports/bluetooth-notes.md." (at 77.47 182.3 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f29da286-84be-415f-903a-69f3d755f2f5"))
(text "J8 programming/test (isUpdate/Config Tool): 1 RST_N, 2 P3_4 SYS_CFG (low at reset = test mode), 3 UART_RXD (adapter TX), 4 UART_TXD (adapter RX), 5 GND. 3V8_BT must be enabled first." (at 77.47 185.3 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5d65863f-7b3a-4f14-b780-3dadedc6aead"))
